Package: projMapR
Type: Package
Title: Map Project File Structures and Data Lineage.
Version: 0.1.3
Author: [Jeongyoon Lee] <jeongyoonlee.jay@gmail.com>
Maintainer: [Jeongyoon Lee] <jeongyoonlee.jay@gmail.com>
Description: A lightweight utility designed to audit and document complex data projects.
             It generates comprehensive file inventories, detects exact duplicates via MD5 harshing,
             and performs static code analysis on R scripts to trace data import and export flows.
             Results can be exported to multi-sheet Excel reports for easy collaboration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
